Sokha is describing his classmates. Dara is outgoing and talkative: she loves meeting people. Minh is a shy person, but he is very sensible. Nok is easy-going and never gets angry. Vibol is ambitious: he wants to be a doctor. Sokha's little brother is a bit moody in the morning. Ms. Lily is a confident person.

